{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:4559159c928c8ed9","name":"TT-6 Landspeeder","source":{"id":"source:reference-4559159c928c8ed9","title":"TT-6 Landspeeder","revision":26297,"timestamp":"2025-03-17T01:03:24Z","sha256":"c0c7eb1d09bd5242c22880b6b2fb290e93d80297813eafb6b0edd1e4a632abf2","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=26297","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=TT-6%20Landspeeder&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-4559159c928c8ed9","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The SoroSuub TT-6 Landspeeder is the iconic personal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Old Republic Era"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Old_Republic_Era"},". A two-seater landspeeder with large rear engines and an aerodynamic body, the TT-6 is mass-produced by SoroSuub to provide an inexpensive and appealing ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speeder"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speeder"}," for personal use. ",{"tag":"a","children":["The SoroSuub Corporation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_SoroSuub_Corporation","referenceId":"reference:98bcb386dd9e3201"}," produces the TT-6 model for nearly 200 years- one of the longest production runs in galactic history. Though advancements in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," technology are incorporated into the TT-6 as time goes on, the basic design and aesthetic of the landspeeder remains unchanged. As a result, one might find an old, beat-up TT-6 for sale in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Outer Rim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Outer_Rim?action=edit&redlink=1"}," junkyard, while eager buyers on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Corellia"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Corellia","referenceId":"reference:b23d752dcc50dee4"}," snap up sleek new TT-6 Landspeeders at the same time.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The TT-6 is a reliable ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speeder"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speeder"}," that has proven to be a solid investment for those looking for a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," that will work for years to come. Though the TT-6 Landspeeder boasts few of the amenities of more expensive luxury ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speeders"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speeders","referenceId":"reference:be93ac2e4867f0ca"},", this solidly built Landspeeder is one of the easiest ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," to keep in good repair. As a result, any character attempting a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Repair"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Repair"}," a TT-6 Landspeeder gains a +2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus on the check.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Normal)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["TT-6 Landspeeder Statistics (CL 1)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Large ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speeder"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speeder"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +8; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +5\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"